{title: Aathi Ena Nee}
{artist: Anirudh Vishal Dadlani Kaththi}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm] Aathi en [C] nee paaththa udaney,        [Bb] kaaththil vacha [C] iragaanen.
[Dm] kaattu mara [C] ma valarndha iva [Bb] no,        yeththi vecha [C] melugaanen.
[D] kora pulla or [G] nodiyil,        [Em] vaanavillaa [A] thirichaaye
[D] paarakalla maru [G] nodiyil,        [Em] eera mannaa [A] kolachaaye.
[Dm] ooru azha [C] gi ulaga azha [Bb] gi,        [Am] yaarumilla unna pola
[Gm] vaadi nerungi paapom pasha [A] gi,        [Dm] un azhagil, en idhayam
[C] than nilayai marandhu marandhu,        [Bb] konjidavum minjidavum
[C] varugudhu urugudhu.        [Dm] un vazhiyil en payanam
[C] vandhadaya nadandhu nadandhu,        [Bb] anjidavum injidavum
[C] sedharudhu padharudhu,        [Dm] un azhagil, en idhayam
[Bb] than nilayai marandhu marandhu,        [C] konjidavum minjidavum
[Dm] varugudhu urugudhu.        [Dm] un vazhiyil en payanam
[Bb] vandhadaya nadandhu nadandhu,        [C] anjidavum injidavum
[Dm] sedharudhu padharudhu,        [Dm] Saami sela polae [C] pirandhu
[Bb] boomiyile [C] nadandhaaye,        [Dm] dhoosiyena kannil [C] vilundhu
[Bb] aaruyiraai [C] kalandhaaye,        [A] Kaal mulacha [G] rangoliyaa
[D] nee nadandhu [F] vaara pulla,        [A] kallu patta [G] kannaadiyaa
naan udanju poren ulla,        [D] Jadayaula [G] dhevadhayaa
[Em] minjudura [A] azhagaaga,        [D] paarvayila [G] vaasanaya
[Em] thoovidura [G] vasamaaga
